    "Criteria: C1 threat, C2 vulnerability, C3 consequence (cost: more is riskier), C4 detectability and C5 reaction (benefit). Ratings and weights are linguistic terms mapped to TFNs (Tables 1, 2, 4); the fuzzy matrix of Table 5 is stored as TFNs.",
